    summary_en: "Silicon Intelligence's Qianzhan (7898) announced a security incident report on September 1st, detailing that its ERP system was subjected to an encryption attack. The company's information security unit immediately initiated comprehensive detection, incident investigation, and protective measures, and is currently continuing to confirm the scope and root cause of the incident. Qianzhan preliminarily assessed that the incident has no significant impact on its financial status, operations, or overall business. Notably, the company emphasized its implemented segmentation mechanism, pointing out that the ERP system and the R&D environment's information systems are separately controlled in terms of network environment, access rights, and data storage. Therefore, the attack was confined solely to the ERP system, and no spread to the R&D environment's information systems has been detected, indicating the effectiveness of its cybersecurity protective measures.",
