    category: "Linux",
    title: "TrueNAS Core 替代方案浮現：FreeBSD 15 新版 FreeCORE 與 BSDnas 專案接力維護 NAS 系統",
    summary: "由於 iXsystems 於 2024 年取消了基於 FreeBSD 的 TrueNAS Core NAS 作業系統，許多用戶尋求替代方案。本文介紹了兩個新的專案：FreeCORE-15.0-U1 和 BSDnas。FreeCORE 專案聲稱是「TrueNAS CORE — continued」，它將 TrueNAS CORE 13.3 系統遷移到基於 FreeBSD 15 的環境，並包含最新的安全修補。BSDnas 則是另一個獨立的專案，同樣基於 FreeBSD 15 的原始 TrueNAS Core 13.3 代碼，並移除了 iXsystems 的依賴。這些新專案旨在為 TrueNAS Core 的用戶提供持續的維護和升級路徑。此外，文章也提及了歷史悠久的 XigmaNAS，它基於 FreeBSD 14，是從 FreeNAS 8 進行的獨立分支。這些替代方案為用戶提供了在 FreeBSD 平台上繼續運行 NAS 服務的選擇，但用戶需注意各專案的獨立性與穩定性。",
    tags: ["FreeBSD", "TrueNAS Core", "FreeCORE", "BSDnas", "NAS OS", "iXsystems", "ZFS"],
    title_en: "TrueNAS Core Alternatives Emerge: FreeBSD 15 FreeCORE and BSDnas Projects Take Over NAS System Maintenance",
    summary_en: "Following iXsystems' discontinuation of the FreeBSD-based TrueNAS Core NAS operating system in 2024, many users have been seeking alternative solutions. This article introduces two new projects: FreeCORE-15.0-U1 and BSDnas. The FreeCORE project claims to be a continuation of \"TrueNAS CORE,\" migrating the TrueNAS CORE 13.3 system to an environment based on FreeBSD 15, and incorporating the latest security patches. BSDnas is another independent project, also based on the original TrueNAS Core 13.3 code using FreeBSD 15, but removing iXsystems' dependencies. These new projects aim to provide a continuous maintenance and upgrade path for TrueNAS Core users. Furthermore, the article mentions the long-standing XigmaNAS, which is based on FreeBSD 14 and represents an independent fork from FreeNAS 8. These alternatives offer users options to continue running NAS services on the FreeBSD platform, but users should be mindful of the independence and stability of each project.",
    tags_en: ["FreeBSD", "TrueNAS Core", "FreeCORE", "BSDnas", "NAS OS", "iXsystems", "ZFS"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/storage/2026/09/02/offshoots-of-cancelled-truenas-core-upgrade-to-freebsd-15/5293725", lang: "EN" }
    ]
