    title: "Google Chrome 新版本修補 26 個資安漏洞，包含記憶體安全與授權問題",
    summary: "Google 在 9 月 1 日發布了 Chrome 瀏覽器的最新版本，包括桌面版（Windows、Linux、Mac）和行動裝置版（Android、iOS）。本次更新共修補了 26 個資安漏洞，其中包含兩個重大漏洞和九個高風險等級漏洞。從技術細節來看，修補的元件中，檔案系統互動元件（FileSystem）佔比最高，其次是全螢幕模式元件（FullScreen）和分頁列元件（TabStrip）。漏洞類型方面，記憶體安全問題，特別是已釋放記憶體仍被使用的問題（UAF），佔了修補漏洞總數的一半以上，另有七個授權機制錯誤問題。使用者應儘快更新至最新版本，以防範潛在的資安風險。",
    tags: ["Google Chrome", "資安漏洞", "UAF", "記憶體安全", "瀏覽器安全", "CVE"],
    title_en: "Google Chrome New Version Patches 26 Security Vulnerabilities, Including Memory Safety and Authorization Issues",
    summary_en: "Google released the latest version of Chrome browser on September 1st, covering desktop versions (Windows, Linux, Mac) and mobile versions (Android, iOS). This update patches a total of 26 security vulnerabilities, including two critical vulnerabilities and nine high-risk vulnerabilities. From a technical perspective, the patched components are dominated by the FileSystem component, followed by the FullScreen component and the TabStrip component. Regarding vulnerability types, memory safety issues, particularly Use-After-Free (UAF), account for over half of the total patched vulnerabilities, alongside seven authorization mechanism errors. Users are advised to update to the latest version promptly to prevent potential security risks.",
