    title: "MapQuest Android 應用程式存在路徑遍歷漏洞，影響特定版本",
    summary: "在 MapQuest Get Directions App 10.16.1 的 Android 平台上，發現了一個安全漏洞。此漏洞存在於元件 com.mapquest.android.ace 中的 ExpoShareIntentModule.kt 檔案的 getDataColumn 函式中。攻擊者可以透過操縱特定功能觸發路徑遍歷（path traversal）行為。此漏洞的攻擊需要本地接近性（locally）才能發動。目前，該漏洞的利用程式碼已公開，存在被惡意利用的風險。儘管廠商在披露初期已被聯繫，但尚未收到任何回應。建議使用者及相關人員密切關注此安全公告，並留意 MapQuest 官方是否有發布修補或更新。",
    tags: ["MapQuest", "CVE-2026-84442", "Android", "路徑遍歷", "應用程式安全"],
    title_en: "Path Traversal Vulnerability Found in MapQuest Android Application Affecting Specific Versions",
    summary_en: "A security vulnerability has been discovered in the MapQuest Get Directions App 10.16.1 on the Android platform. This vulnerability resides in the getDataColumn function within the ExpoShareIntentModule.kt file of the com.mapquest.android.ace component. An attacker can trigger path traversal by manipulating specific functionalities. Exploitation of this vulnerability requires local proximity. Currently, exploit code for this vulnerability has been made public, posing a risk of malicious exploitation. Although the vendor was contacted during the initial disclosure, no response has been received. Users and relevant personnel are advised to closely monitor this security announcement and watch for any patches or updates released by MapQuest official channels.",
    tags_en: ["MapQuest", "CVE-2026-84442", "Android", "Path Traversal", "Application Security"],
