    summary: "Dell於IFA展會宣布推出全新Dell 14S筆記型電腦，主打「高性價比」的日常使用市場，目標受眾為學生和一般用戶。這款筆電具備鋁合金機身、長達21小時的電池續航力，並搭載Intel Core Ultra 3或Core Ultra 5處理器。其螢幕為16:10比例，提供60Hz和120Hz選項，連接埠配置包含兩個USB-C和一個HDMI埠，並配備耳機孔。Dell將14S定位為MacBook Neo的具競爭力替代品，並暗示其價格可能低於XPS 13系列。雖然尚未公布具體價格，但該機型預計今年秋季在美國上市，旨在提供一款兼具便攜性、長續航和易於負擔的選擇。",
    tags: ["Dell", "Dell 14S", "Intel Core Ultra", "筆記型電腦", "學生族群", "IFA"],
    title_en: "Dell Unveils New 14S Laptop: Targeting Students and Everyday Use with Emphasis on High Value and Long Battery Life",
    summary_en: "At the IFA exhibition, Dell announced the launch of the new Dell 14S laptop, focusing on the everyday use market with a 'high value' proposition, aimed at students and general users. This laptop features an aluminum chassis, up to 21 hours of battery life, and is equipped with either an Intel Core Ultra 3 or Core Ultra 5 processor. Its screen has a 16:10 aspect ratio, offering both 60Hz and 120Hz options, and the connectivity includes two USB-C ports, one HDMI port, and a headphone jack. Dell positions the 14S as a competitive alternative to the MacBook Neo, hinting that its price may be lower than the XPS 13 series. Although specific pricing has not been announced, the model is expected to launch in the US this fall, aiming to provide a portable, long-lasting, and affordable option.",
