    category: "重點關注",
    title: "綠色和平警告：AI發展對Apple環境承諾構成最大威脅，能源消耗成關鍵檢驗點",
    summary: "綠色和平組織指出，隨著AI技術的廣泛採用，特別是Apple Intelligence等新功能，將對Apple的環境紀錄構成最大挑戰。雖然Apple迄今在環境方面取得了卓越成就，但AI功能所帶來的龐大資料中心運算需求，可能極大地增加能源消耗。綠色和平認為，Apple如何應對這一挑戰，將是檢驗其環境承諾是否真誠的「決定性考驗」。文章強調，AI的發展趨勢與能源效率的平衡，是科技巨頭必須面對的重大議題，要求企業必須在追求技術進步的同時，兼顧永續發展與環境責任。",
    tags: ["Greenpeace", "Apple", "AI", "環境永續", "資料中心", "能源消耗"],
    title_en: "Greenpeace Warns: AI Development Poses Biggest Threat to Apple's Environmental Commitments; Energy Consumption is Key Test Point",
    summary_en: "Greenpeace has pointed out that the widespread adoption of AI technology, particularly new features like Apple Intelligence, poses the greatest challenge to Apple's environmental record. Although Apple has achieved remarkable environmental success so far, the massive data center computing demands brought by AI features could significantly increase energy consumption. Greenpeace believes that how Apple addresses this challenge will be the 'decisive test' of the sincerity of its environmental commitments. The article emphasizes that balancing AI development trends with energy efficiency is a major issue that tech giants must face, requiring companies to consider sustainable development and environmental responsibility while pursuing technological advancement.",
    tags_en: ["Greenpeace", "Apple", "AI", "Environmental Sustainability", "Data Center", "Energy Consumption"],
