    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "KDE Plasma 6.8 支援 Dwell Clicker，強化 Wayland 環境的無障礙性功能",
    summary: "KDE Plasma 6.8 版本為提升無障礙使用者體驗，新增了 Dwell Clicker（停留點擊）支援功能。此功能旨在取代在 X11 環境下 KDE Plasma 使用的 KMouseTool 功能。Dwell Clicker 允許使用者僅需讓游標停留在指定位置，而無需按下實體按鈕，即可模擬滑鼠點擊。這對於患有癱瘓、行動不便或無法使用實體滑鼠按鈕的用戶極為重要。該功能已整合到 Plasma 6.8 的 Wayland 環境中，並包含 KWin 端的支援，同時也增加了 Plasma Applet 和 KCM 來配置此項無障礙選項。預計 Plasma 6.8 將於 10 月 14 日發布。",
    tags: ["KDE Plasma", "Plasma 6.8", "Wayland", "Dwell Clicker", "KWin", "無障礙性"],
    title_en: "KDE Plasma 6.8 Supports Dwell Clicker, Enhancing Accessibility in Wayland Environment",
    summary_en: "The KDE Plasma 6.8 version introduces Dwell Clicker support to improve the experience for users with accessibility needs. This feature is designed to replace the KMouseTool function used in KDE Plasma within the X11 environment. Dwell Clicker allows users to simulate a mouse click simply by keeping the cursor stationary at a specified location, without needing to press a physical button. This is particularly crucial for users with paralysis, mobility impairments, or those unable to use physical mouse buttons. The feature has been integrated into the Wayland environment of Plasma 6.8, including support on the KWin side, and also adds Plasma Applet and KCM for configuring this accessibility option. Plasma 6.8 is expected to be released on October 14.",
