    id: "20260902-10719",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "GNOME Mutter 51.rc 釋出：新增跨 GPU 緩衝區掃描支援與背景效果政策",
    summary: "GNOME 正在準備發布 51.rc 版本，其中 Mutter 和 GNOME Shell 均已標記出現在的發行候選版。Mutter 51.rc 的主要亮點是新增了跨 GPU 緩衝區掃描支援，這對於具備多 GPU 配置的混合筆電等設備能提高效率。此外，該版本還增加了支援觸控筆橡皮擦按鈕配置、支援缺乏 GAMMA_LUT 能力硬體上的夜間模式，以及覆寫客戶端初始配置的功能。在背景效果方面，Mutter 51.rc 引入了客戶端請求背景模糊支援的政策，預設參數為模糊半徑 24、飽和度 1.25 和雜訊 0.015。修復內容包括使用硬體游標處理 SVG 游標、修正多個顯示器被報告為主顯示器、修正 HDR 模式下去飽和的 SDR 內容，以及修復了在沒有 DMA-BUF 時的直接掃描（direct scan-out）捕獲問題。GNOME Shell 51.rc 則採用基於 Rust 的 Glycin 函式庫來載入和快取背景圖片，並修復了直接掃描的使用相關問題。",
    tags: ["GNOME", "Mutter", "GNOME Shell", "51.rc", "跨 GPU", "Linux"],
    title_en: "GNOME Mutter 51.rc Release: Adds Cross-GPU Buffer Scanning Support and Background Effects Policy",
    summary_en: "GNOME is preparing to release the 51.rc version, with both Mutter and GNOME Shell marked as being in the release candidate. The main highlight of Mutter 51.rc is the addition of cross-GPU buffer scanning support, which is expected to improve efficiency on devices with multi-GPU configurations, such as hybrid laptops. Furthermore, this version adds support for configuring stylus eraser buttons, enables night mode on hardware lacking GAMMA_LUT capability, and introduces functionality to override client initial configurations. Regarding background effects, Mutter 51.rc introduces a policy supporting client requests for background blur, with default parameters set to a blur radius of 24, saturation of 1.25, and noise of 0.015. Fixes include using hardware cursor processing for SVG cursors, correcting multiple displays being reported as the primary display, fixing SDR content desaturation in HDR mode, and resolving a direct scan-out capture issue when DMA-BUF is unavailable. GNOME Shell 51.rc, meanwhile, utilizes the Rust-based Glycin library to load and cache background images, and fixes issues related to direct scan-out usage.",
    tags_en: ["GNOME", "Mutter", "GNOME Shell", "51.rc", "Cross-GPU", "Linux"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/GNOME-Shell-Mutter-51-RC", lang: "EN" }
    ]
