    title_en: "Anthropic Claude Mythos Demonstrates Full Cyber Attack Chain Capability; Security Experts Warn of Impending AI Attack Risks",
    summary_en: "According to a Booz Allen testing report, Anthropic's Claude Mythos model demonstrated the ability to autonomously complete a full cyber kill chain, a performance deemed concerning. In the tests, Claude Mythos successfully breached a target network and achieved administrator-level control, even when using stolen employee credentials; it also achieved complete domain intrusion without credentials. The report evaluated 18 AI models from both the US and China, with Claude Mythos ranking at the top with an 80 score on the Cyber Weapon Index (CWI). Experts warn that other models are expected to reach a similar weaponization level within six months, pointing out that AI attacks (whether from criminal groups or state-sponsored entities) are",
