    title: "Google發布Gemini 3.8 Flash，強化AI模型競爭力，並推出專用安全版本",
    summary: "Google於本週宣布發布Gemini 3.8 Flash，旨在重振其在頂級AI模型市場的聲譽。此模型是Google第四款Flash系列模型，相較於前代，它在智能度上有了顯著提升，並能以相對低廉的成本執行複雜的工程任務。根據Google內部資料，Gemini 3.8 Flash在DeepSWE v1.1（長期軟體工程）測試中，表現優於許多大型頂級模型，且成本極低。在人工分析智能指數（Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index）上，Gemini 3.8 Flash的評分為59，與GPT-5.6 Sol和Grok 4.6持平。此外，Google還推出了專為政府、關鍵基礎設施和軟體維護者設計的Gemini 3.8 Flash Cyber版本，專用於軟體漏洞狩獵與修復。開發者可透過Google Antigravity、Gemini API等管道使用，企業用戶可使用Gemini Enterprise，消費者則可透過Gemini App等介面存取。",
    tags: ["Google", "Gemini 3.8 Flash", "AI 模型", "DeepSWE v1.1", "CVE", "AI 競爭"],
    title_en: "Google Releases Gemini 3.8 Flash to Boost AI Model Competitiveness and Introduces Dedicated Security Version",
    summary_en: "Google announced the release of Gemini 3.8 Flash this week, aiming to revitalize its standing in the top-tier AI model market. This model is Google's fourth Flash series model, and compared to its predecessor, it shows significant improvements in intelligence while executing complex engineering tasks at a relatively low cost. According to internal Google data, Gemini 3.8 Flash outperformed many large top-tier models in the DeepSWE v1.1 (long-term software engineering) test, all while maintaining extremely low costs. Furthermore, Google introduced a specialized Gemini 3.8 Flash Cyber version designed for governments, critical infrastructure, and software maintainers, specifically for software vulnerability hunting and remediation. Developers can access it through channels like Google Antigravity and the Gemini API, enterprise users can utilize Gemini Enterprise, and consumers can access it via interfaces such as the Gemini App.",
    tags_en: ["Google", "Gemini 3.8 Flash", "AI Model", "DeepSWE v1.1", "CVE", "AI Competition"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/ai-and-ml/2026/09/02/with-gemini-38-flash-google-reminds-everyone-its-still-in-the-race/5294049", lang: "EN" }
    ]
