    category: "產業動態",
    title: "多家大企業遭供應鏈攻擊：利用通用採購系統漏洞導致個人資料外洩",
    summary: "近期，SK이노베이션（SK Innovation）和롯데케미칼（Lotte Chemical）等大型企業遭受系統入侵，導致個人資料外洩。此次事件被定性為典型的「供應鏈攻擊」（Supply Chain Attack），攻擊者並非直接攻擊企業自身安全防線，而是利用了許多大企業採用的第三方採購系統（E사）的漏洞作為入侵途徑。SK이노베이션的員工資料，包括姓名、部門、職位、聯絡電話和內部電子郵件地址等被洩露，但未包含敏感的國民註冊號碼或金融資訊。롯데케미칼也確認了內部系統ECOMS遭受入侵，洩露了姓名、ID、手機號碼和電子郵件地址等部分個人資料。兩家公司在發現異常後迅速採取了封鎖系統和向相關政府機構報告的初期應對措施。然而，專家警告，洩露的聯絡資訊可能成為後續釣魚或惡意簡訊攻擊的溫床。此次事件凸顯了企業在採購系統等外部合作夥伴軟體安全層級不足時，可能面臨的巨大連鎖風險，呼籲企業加強整體安全審查和防禦措施。",
    tags: ["供應鏈攻擊", "SK이노베이션", "롯데케미칼", "採購系統", "資訊安全", "個人資料外洩"],
    title_en: "Multiple Large Corporations Hit by Supply Chain Attack: Personal Data Leakage via Common Procurement System Vulnerability",
    summary_en: "Recently, large corporations such as SK Innovation and Lotte Chemical suffered system intrusions, leading to personal data leakage. This incident has been characterized as a typical \"Supply Chain Attack,\" where attackers did not directly target the companies' own security defenses, but instead exploited vulnerabilities in third-party procurement systems (Company E) adopted by many large enterprises as an entry point. Employee data from SK Innovation, including names, departments, job titles, contact phone numbers, and internal email addresses, was leaked, but sensitive national identification numbers or financial information were not included. Lotte Chemical also confirmed that its internal system, ECOMS, was compromised, leaking partial personal data such as names, IDs, mobile phone numbers, and email addresses. Both companies quickly implemented initial response measures after detecting the anomaly, including system isolation and reporting to relevant government agencies. However, experts warn that the leaked contact information could become a breeding ground for subsequent phishing or malicious SMS attacks. This incident highlights the massive cascading risks enterprises face when external partner software, such as procurement systems, lacks sufficient security levels, calling for companies to strengthen overall security reviews and defensive measures.",
    tags_en: ["Supply Chain Attack", "SK Innovation", "Lotte Chemical", "Procurement System", "Information Security", "Personal Data Leakage"],
