    category: "產業動態",
    title: "Suprema 參加印度 FSIE 2026：發表先進生物識別門禁系統 BioStation 3 Max",
    summary: "專精於智慧出入口控制及實體安全解決方案的企業 Suprema（슈프리마）將參加在印度孟買舉行的「FSIE(Fire & Security India Expo) 2026」，鎖定印度市場。在本次展會上，Suprema 除了展示其主力產品人臉辨識終端機 'BioStation 3'，更將首次向印度市場公開最新的旗艦型號 'BioStation 3 Max'。BioStation 3 Max 搭載了 CC EAL6+ 等級的安全性元件，除了人臉和指紋生物識別外，還整合了 RFID、行動裝置認證、QR Code、PIN 等多樣化的認證方式，是一款進階的終端機。此外，Suprema 還將展示本地部署的整合安全平台 'BioStar X' 和雲端原生平台 'BioStar Air'，旨在協助客戶根據自身環境靈活地建構和擴展系統。Suprema 計劃透過 AI 驅動的 'Q-Face Finder'，將解決方案應用於失蹤者搜尋和嫌疑人追蹤等公共安全場景，並透過與 Genetec、Milestone 等主要系統的整合展示，證明其市場競爭力。",
    tags: ["Suprema", "BioStation 3 Max", "FSIE 2026", "實體安全", "出入口控制", "BioStar X"],
    title_en: "Suprema to Exhibit at FSIE 2026 in India: Unveiling Advanced Biometric Access Control System BioStation 3 Max",
    summary_en: "Suprema, a company specializing in smart access control and physical security solutions, will participate in the 'FSIE (Fire & Security India Expo) 2026' in Mumbai, India, targeting the Indian market. At this exhibition, Suprema will not only showcase its flagship facial recognition terminal, 'BioStation 3', but will also debut its latest high-end model, 'BioStation 3 Max', to the Indian market. The BioStation 3 Max incorporates security elements up to CC EAL6+ grade and integrates diverse authentication methods beyond facial and fingerprint biometrics, including RFID, mobile device authentication, QR Code, and PIN, making it an advanced terminal. Furthermore, Suprema plans to display the locally deployed integrated security platform 'BioStar X' and the cloud-native platform 'BioStar Air', designed to help clients flexibly build and expand systems according to their specific environments. Suprema also plans to demonstrate the application of its AI-driven 'Q-Face Finder' in public safety scenarios such as missing person search and suspect tracking, proving its market competitiveness through integration displays with major systems like Genetec and Milestone.",
