    category: "產業動態",
    title: "Akamai推出Workforce Protector：提供全方位員工與AI互動的邊界安全保護",
    summary: "Akamai Technology宣布推出「Akamai Workforce Protector」，這是其於7月收購的「LayerX」的更名產品。此解決方案旨在保護員工在與AI、SaaS、Web、私人應用程式及企業數據互動的各個接觸點。它提供全面的可視性、AI使用控制、安全企業瀏覽器功能以及實時資料外洩防護（DLP）。該產品可與Akamai的全球私人連線解決方案整合，旨在填補傳統安全服務邊緣（SSE）、雲端存取安全代理（CASB）和DLP工具未能解決的安全空白。Workforce Protector能夠追蹤影子AI的使用情況，並控制員工使用AI工具的方式，能在瀏覽器會話內應用適應性政策。它能防止敏感數據被上傳到未經授權的AI模型，或從企業應用程式下載到員工端點。該產品的核心概念是「互動安全」，旨在克服傳統邊界式安全模型，將安全直接應用於所有互動點，幫助企業在不減緩工作效率的前提下，安全地推行AI應用。",
    tags: ["Akamai", "Workforce Protector", "AI安全", "DLP", "SSE", "CASB"],
    title_en: "Akamai Launches Workforce Protector: Comprehensive Edge Security for Employee and AI Interactions",
    summary_en: "Akamai Technology announced the launch of \"Akamai Workforce Protector,\" a rebranded product derived from its acquisition of \"LayerX\" in July. This solution is designed to protect employees at every touchpoint where they interact with AI, SaaS, Web, private applications, and corporate data. It provides comprehensive visibility, AI usage control, secure enterprise browser functionality, and real-time Data Loss Prevention (DLP). The product integrates with Akamai's global private connectivity solutions, aiming to fill security gaps that traditional Security Service Edge (SSE), Cloud Access Security Broker (CASB), and DLP tools have failed to address. Workforce Protector can track shadow AI usage and control how employees use AI tools, applying adaptive policies within the browser session. It prevents sensitive data from being uploaded to unauthorized AI models or downloaded from enterprise applications to employee endpoints. The core concept of this product is \"interaction security,\" designed to overcome traditional perimeter security models by applying security directly to all interaction points, helping enterprises safely implement AI applications without reducing work efficiency.",
    tags_en: ["Akamai", "Workforce Protector", "AI Security", "DLP", "SSE", "CASB"],
